cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Botwiner: reproducible execution-aware Pump.fun market research"
message: "If this research or code is useful, please cite the repository and the negative-result report."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dallo
    given-names: Obada
repository-code: "https://github.com/obadadallo95/botwiner"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research pipeline for causal Pump.fun market-data capture,
  deterministic replay, finalized evidence enrichment, feed comparison,
  latency-aware simulation, and capital-aware evaluation. The published
  15,467-path sweep is a negative result: no tested configuration was
  production-ready under conservative execution assumptions.
keywords:
  - Solana
  - Pump.fun
  - market-data
  - market-microstructure
  - backtesting
  - reproducible research
  - quantitative finance
  - TypeScript
  - negative results
license: MIT
